{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05这类停留时间较短的段落，X的感受文字仍然偏密，扫读速度明显不如Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然文字更多，但重点词放大加亮，能让观众迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化；感受又有完整的声音、身体和情绪描述，部分内容随音乐节点出现，使感受不是一堆并列标签，而是有起伏、有转折的过程。尤其从最初不敢靠近，到逐渐享受亲近、害怕失去、短暂释然、重新面对不确定，X的前后呼应和情感递进更充分。Y的优势是轻快好扫，但右侧短词压缩掉了一些重要的感受过渡，部分地方容易只记住几个情绪标签，难以获得X那种细腻、连续的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fe0bf334-63a3-4a81-883b-da1679e4019d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T023846168893Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.36, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:39:49.540690+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e3842d5983225e7a5d70c874f944e3b4ae8bc5040fa56b15b6fa2c5be976cad3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg